meta {
  name: Update Project API
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

put {
  url: {{base_url}}/settings/project/api
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: text/html, application/xhtml+xml
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
  X-Inertia: true
  X-Inertia-Version: REPLACE_WITH_ASSET_VERSION
}

body:json {
  {
    "public_api_allowed_origins": [
      "http://localhost:3000",
      "https://www.example.com"
    ]
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Update Project API
  
  Saves CORS allowlist only (`public_api_allowed_origins`). Invalidates the Public API origins cache.
  
  **Method:** PUT  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/settings/project/api`  
  **Route name:** `project.api.update`  
  **Permission:** `CanManageProjectSettings`
  
  ## Body
  
  Origins must be `http(s)` with **no path** (e.g. `https://www.example.com`). CSV string is also accepted and split server-side.
  
  ```json
  {
    "public_api_allowed_origins": ["http://localhost:3000"]
  }
  ```
  
  Empty / omit → clear allowlist (Public API open to any Origin, subject to key/role rules).
  
  ## Bruno extras
  
  - Session `Cookie` + CSRF (`X-XSRF-TOKEN`) required
  - `X-Inertia` / `X-Inertia-Version` optional; without them expect a normal redirect (`302`) to `project.api.edit`
  
  ## Gaps
  
  Cannot fully smoke-test Inertia flash without a browser session + matching asset version. Prefer the UI for day-to-day saves; use this request to verify the route exists and auth/CSRF behave.
}
